    "metadata": {
        "methodology": "The simulation parameters were derived from empirical research data provided, focusing on average hourly salaries for proxy roles in Poland (converted to EUR) and standard processing time benchmarks for administrative tasks. Where direct benchmarks for specific university tasks were unavailable, conservative extrapolations were made based on general administrative process times and the hierarchical level of the role involved. Industry frameworks like APQC PCF and Lean Six Sigma principles guided the understanding of process efficiency and typical administrative cycle times.",
